{"title": "Sunlight Weakness", "pageid": 9379, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sunlight_Weakness", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sunlight Weakness</b> is a passive feature that imposes strong penalties when in sunlight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While in sunlight, this creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Charismatic_Sentinel\" title=\"Charismatic Sentinel\">Charismatic Sentinel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doggy\" title=\"Doggy\">Doggy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligent_Sentinel\" title=\"Intelligent Sentinel\">Intelligent Sentinel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarin\" title=\"Sarin\">Sarin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Friend\" title=\"Shadow Friend\">Shadow Friend</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff\">Shadow Mastiff</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff_Alpha\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff Alpha\">Shadow Mastiff Alpha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Plush\" title=\"Shadow Plush\">Shadow Plush</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Judge\" title=\"The Judge\">The Judge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wise_Sentinel\" title=\"Wise Sentinel\">Wise Sentinel</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack rolls\">attack rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> while in sunlight.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715013735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.